Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.74,Hook,,0,0,0,,LE LLEGARON JOY-CON\NPIRATAS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ayer pedí unos Joy-Con\Npara mi Switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:04.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Ahorita salgo del cuarto y\Nveo que están los Joy-Con
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:05.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}en...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.18,0:00:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}en la mesa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:11.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Agarro los Joy-Con y me\Ndoy cuenta de una
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:11.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}cosa:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:15.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}los Joy-Con no dicen\N«Nintendo Switch 2»,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.64,0:00:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}dicen «Switch Nintendo».
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.58,0:00:23.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Eso ya es raro, ¿vale?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:25.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Giro la caja, wey, y...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:31.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}veo unos controles que\Nparecen de juguete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:34.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No son originales. Se ven\Ncomo de juguete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.37,0:00:37.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Los compré en Coupang, que\Nes el Amazon de acá.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:40.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Todo piratón, wey.
